<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In What is a protest anyway? Codebook conceptualization is still a first-order concern in LLM-era classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Breakdown of the pragmatic approach</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In What is a protest anyway? Codebook conceptualization is still a first-order concern in LLM-era classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Additional Simulation Details</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS1" title="In Appendix D Additional Simulation Details ‣ What is a protest anyway? Codebook conceptualization is still a first-order concern in LLM-era classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.1 </span>True DGP</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS2" title="In Appendix D Additional Simulation Details ‣ What is a protest anyway? Codebook conceptualization is still a first-order concern in LLM-era classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2 </span>Simulating annotations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS3" title="In Appendix D Additional Simulation Details ‣ What is a protest anyway? Codebook conceptualization is still a first-order concern in LLM-era classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.3 </span>Estimation with DSL</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS4" title="In Appendix D Additional Simulation Details ‣ What is a protest anyway? Codebook conceptualization is still a first-order concern in LLM-era classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.4 </span>Results</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
